- id: shadowfax_per_driver_trail
  alias: Shadowfax - Per-driver GPS trail
  description: Publishes Shadowfax GPS to per-driver MQTT trackers so the map shows
    a separate colored trail per driver (replaces Grafana/InfluxDB driver tagging)
  mode: queued
  max_exceeded: silent
  triggers:
  - trigger: state
    entity_id: sensor.shadowfax_trip_data
    attribute: latitude
  - trigger: state
    entity_id: sensor.shadowfax_trip_data
    attribute: longitude
  conditions:
  - condition: template
    value_template: >-
      {{ states('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data') in ['Brian R.', 'Nick C.']
         and state_attr('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data', 'latitude') is not none }}
  actions:
  - action: mqtt.publish
    data:
      topic: >-
        shadowfax/{{ 'brian' if states('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data') == 'Brian R.' else 'nick' }}/attributes
      retain: true
      payload: >-
        {"latitude": {{ state_attr('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data', 'latitude') }},
         "longitude": {{ state_attr('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data', 'longitude') }},
         "gps_accuracy": 0,
         "speed": {{ state_attr('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data', 'speed') | default(0, true) }},
         "drive_mode": "{{ state_attr('sensor.shadowfax_trip_data', 'drive_mode') }}"}
- id: watchdog_z_flip_5_relay_offline
  alias: Watchdog - Z Flip 5 relay phone offline
  description: 'Created 2026-07-22: the Google Home notification relay (spare Z Flip
    5, "Android Notification Phone") silently stopped reporting to HA for ~23h after
    the 00:53 07-21 restart, killing Airbnb arrival detection. Alerts when the phone
    has not pushed a battery sensor update for 4 hours. The now() template trigger
    re-evaluates once per minute and fires once per offline episode.'
  triggers:
  - trigger: template
    value_template: >-
      {{ states.sensor.android_notification_phone_battery_level is not none and
         (now() - states.sensor.android_notification_phone_battery_level.last_updated).total_seconds()
         > 14400 }}
  actions:
  - action: notify.mobile_app_brian_s_z_flip_7
    data:
      title: Relay phone offline
      message: >-
        The Z Flip 5 notification relay has not reported to HA for over 4 hours
        (last update {{ states.sensor.android_notification_phone_battery_level.last_updated
        | as_local }}). Airbnb arrival detection via Google Home notifications is
        down. Check the phone: HA companion app connection, Wi-Fi, and whether it
        rebooted.
      data:
        tag: relay-watchdog
        group: watchdog
  - action: persistent_notification.create
    data:
      notification_id: relay_phone_offline
      title: Relay phone offline
      message: >-
        The Z Flip 5 notification relay has not reported to HA for over 4 hours
        (last update {{ states.sensor.android_notification_phone_battery_level.last_updated
        | as_local }}). Airbnb arrival detection via Google Home notifications is
        down until it reconnects.
  mode: single
  max_exceeded: silent
